        google: { rating: 4.6, review_count: 34, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=15739276616178396618&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Andrew', rating: 5, text: 'Confused how you’re *not* mind-blown when you get stuff from a dispensary, of all places?   This is not one of those places!!  Marawana is that spot you always hoped your local dispensary would be like. I have zero need to walk into any other dispo.  Between Vegas, Colorado, Illinois, Michigan, and now finally home in MN, I’ve been let down plenty of times by what I walked out with — especially fo', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Campuzano', rating: 5, text: 'Steve the bud-tender is the best came in the last minute before close and he was still awesome with a great attitude 10 out of 10 service', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Josiah Brown', rating: 5, text: 'So I stopped by today and was amazed at the difference in selection from what I\'m seeing in other dispensaries!! The product is absolutely great, super welcoming and educated also. Recommended the products best for me. The flower I got is super tasty! Will definitely be back and 100% would recommend to friends and family.', time: '4 months ago'}, {author: 'Snow Ryder', rating: 5, text: 'Peter and Jason are literally legendary and amazing. The weed was fantastic and they helped me out with a mission that was important to me. Thank you guys for fantastic customer service I\'ll be back and I\'ll be sure to bring my friends. Definitely recommend stopping here if you\'re looking to fly.', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Keith Vacinek', rating: 5, text: 'Nice and easy!! Got one of there vapes. Really enjoying it!!  It’s definitely one of the best I’ve had locally!', time: '3 months ago'}] }
