        img: "https://images.weedmaps.com/dispensaries/000/396/065/avatar/1781220179-screenshot_2026-06-11_at_4-21-40___pm.png",
        google: { rating: 4.9, review_count: 568, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=17656767879368606479&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'MNlakeland', rating: 5, text: 'Nice crew works here. Casey is his name and always provides good guidance.  You wait in lobby and go in and shop personally, lobby is comfy. Line is quick and arrested development is usually on TV. Thats a comic genius show, soo...they have good taste in comedy. And product what can I say...all good 👍', time: '5 months ago'}, {author: 'Cindy Christians', rating: 5, text: 'I was customer 126 for their grand opening on 03/21/2026 in Maple Grove - the first recreational dispensary in my city!!  I found the experience to be very relaxed and organized. Their waiting room felt like a movie theater.  Once my number was called, I went into the back secure show floor and was met by a friendly salesperson.  I was most interested in finding their specialty products (ice cream', time: '6 months ago'}, {author: 'Nick G', rating: 5, text: 'Im a fan! Interesting way of managing foot traffic for a weed shop, but the guy behind the counter was very personable and friendly. Really wish them well, I think I got a pretty good deal today considering MN prices and taxes. They are a bit tucked away on the side of the building, but it seems like its getting popular! Good product spread - just the stuff I like.', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Brandon K', rating: 5, text: 'I stopped last night because I was in the mood for a preroll after work.  The bud tenders were knowledgeable about the products and they were really friendly also.  I found my new favorite MN dispensary.   I highly recommend giving Full Melt a visit', time: '6 months ago'}, {author: 'iesha atkinson', rating: 5, text: 'When I got in the building it looks amazing. The inside is playing a video u can watch. You listen for your number to go back. It was very nice and everything‘s organized. All the prices. Everything you can see is just out and open for you. Casey was amazing. Took care of me wonderfully. I got great goodies and I got a great deal with rants it give great vibes while high and it’s in a great locati', time: '4 months ago'}] }
