        google: { rating: 4.7, review_count: 163, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=844772929472102350&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'COVID-Shark', rating: 3, text: 'The three stars are for the location and service. The store is very clean, nice layout, and it’s easy to find. The younger gal that helped me was very friendly, but knew little about the flower. I purchased some Flor flower and it was horrible. Not only was it smaller than popcorn size buds at other places, but it was so dry a humidor pack could bring it back. It was harsh and had no flavor. This ', time: '5 months ago'}, {author: 'Dre', rating: 3, text: 'Its pretty alright. The Pros: I love all the employees, they really are nice and fun to talk to. I mostly appreciate the simplicity of the shop and the menu.  The only thing I can say is that their menu is smaller compared to some of the other dispenseries right now.  They are also a little higher priced when it comes to prerolls and bud compared to other spots such as Green Goods and Rise, but di', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Alexander the Great', rating: 5, text: 'Great people, great products, and great service. Everyone is welcoming, knowledgeable, and easy to talk to. You can tell they take pride in what they do. Definitely worth checking out if you’re looking to support a quality local business.', time: '4 months ago'}, {author: 'nishant salaria', rating: 5, text: 'Amazing staff! Amazing product! And great vibes!!! My wife needed something to get her to relax because of her anxiety and these folks had the perfect choice for her. Would buy again from here without any hesitation.', time: '6 months ago'}, {author: 'Alexis Trevino', rating: 5, text: 'Just in town for a little bit and stopped here for maybe 10/15 minutes, and it might be the most fun I had all week  There were two people working and we pretty immediately started chit chatting, I didn’t catch their names but they were both really fun, personable, and knowledgeable about the products as a cherry on top. 10/10 would recommend; they made things quick, easy, and I left feeling a bit', time: '7 months ago'}] }
