        initial: 'NS',
        img: "https://images.weedmaps.com/dispensaries/000/404/461/avatar/1773343631-copy_of_untitled_design__1_.png",
        google: { rating: 4.8, review_count: 146, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=15519918549438453366&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Jenna Yates', rating: 5, text: 'Really nice helpful crew… I bought a new vape there.. very fair prices overall. Will go back!!!! I also lucked up and found a single seed in my flower!!!!! Whoooop', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Chelsey Marie', rating: 5, text: 'Excellent customer service!!! I really appreciate the knowledge about the products being sold and the rewards program. I will not go any where else!', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Jillian Davy/Graves', rating: 5, text: 'Super friendly and knowledgeable staff. Nice organized store! Will be going back for sure 😁', time: 'a month ago'}, {author: 'Kristle Thomasson', rating: 4, text: 'I really liked this shop because it was one of the first places I found with good weed that wasn’t garbage. The staff was friend and they had great discounts. I will say that prices are high and hopefully they come down once they are more established. Pre rolls are much cheaper elsewhere but the weed I got didn’t disappoint.', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Ali Numbers', rating: 5, text: 'I LOVE this dispensary, they’re always in a positive mood and they make sure you leave the store with the best bang for your buck! They’re also willing to order items for you to grab later on. The points system is SO good and definitely worth it!', time: '3 months ago'}] }
