        img: "https://images.weedmaps.com/dispensaries/000/406/550/avatar/1774457643-5025712b-d4b5-4b2c-9644-d64486a36926_1.jpg",
        google: { rating: 4.6, review_count: 45, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=12357543422035386426&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Matthew Shea', rating: 5, text: 'I visited for the first time yesterday, May 16th. Very cool location for a business, the store was very clean and organized as well. The lady that helped me was kind and very helpful. She informed me about their rewards program and its a great idea. You earn points with your purchases that you can eventually redeem for various accessories and swag. She also set me up with a punch card which I thin', time: '5 months ago'}, {author: 'Alicia McDonough', rating: 5, text: 'Living in Silver Bay, it’s been great having Two Harbors Cannabis close by. When they got flower, everything changed! Grateful for the quality flower I have received. They also started a points system like Chuck E. Cheese, where you can redeem them for goodies on the back wall. I’ve only encounter two employees, but they are both superb, friendly and very helpful. Thank you so much for bringing fl', time: '4 months ago'}, {author: 'Butterfly Wine', rating: 2, text: 'I hate to say this because I’m usually a huge fan, come once a week, but I just had a pretty bad experience. The guy behind the counter was pretty rude so be cautious coming here. However if you see an older gentleman he’s the most helpful man I’ve met.', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'R Name', rating: 1, text: 'Horrible. Bad customer service guy was rude and unhelpful. If you go there be sure to be ready to be treated bad by the young guy with a long beard. Been there before and have never been treated that disrespected before .. I’m disappointed because I had shopped there many times but don’t think I’ll go back', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Emma Lynn', rating: 5, text: 'This is a very nice stop to elevate 😉 your trip to the north shore, the shop owner really knows her stuff and will help you make the best choice for your needs!', time: '5 months ago'}] }
