        gradient: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #7c2d12, #dc2626)',
        initial: 'CO',
        img: "https://images.weedmaps.com/dispensaries/000/403/385/avatar/1767896737-coastlesslogo.jpg",
        google: { rating: 4.8, review_count: 123, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=15009670326338621128&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'DYG Rich', rating: 5, text: 'Josh and Kevin some of the best workers I met guys helped us out way from Miami we would be back thanks guys. This guys delivered top service hope to see them managing soon.', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Dean Anderson', rating: 5, text: 'Super cute shop! Highly recommend. Stopped by quick right before close as we were just getting back into Minnesota from a road trip. Literally it was 10 mins before close and Kevin the budtender was so nice and welcoming!  Nice selection of flower! 🍃 There is a cool mural going up, that Kevin said was being done by a local artist. It is looking really pretty! Can\'t wait to see it done next time I ', time: 'a month ago'}, {author: 'Krista Jean', rating: 5, text: 'Best in town! Super chill, patient, helpful. If you don’t know what you want they will help you figure out what’s best for YOU. Can order very easily online for pick up. Worth checking out 🙂', time: '4 months ago'}, {author: 'Kirk John', rating: 5, text: 'Great atmosphere and good prices to get a good smoke', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Tyler Carroll', rating: 5, text: 'Awesome experience. The shop is clean, welcoming, and has a great selection. The staff is super knowledgeable, friendly, and actually takes the time to help you find what you’re looking for without making you feel rushed. You can tell they care about quality and customer service. Definitely worth stopping in if you’re in the area!', time: '6 months ago'}] }
