        features: ["Debit cards accepted", "Online ordering", "Large menu"],
        gradient: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #065f46, #059669)',
        initial: 'WI',
        img: "https://images.weedmaps.com/dispensaries/000/400/574/avatar/1776729651-wildflower-logos_avatar-northeast.jpg",
        google: { rating: 4.7, review_count: 124, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=11438091904175603222&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Erin Kaine', rating: 5, text: 'Woop woop! We love a dispensary in the city with a parking lot &&&&& finally has flower for sale 💚🌱🙌🏼  Updates: love the Grapes N Cream! Great gassy hybrid that burns super clean. That’s what we like to see 👏🏼👏🏼', time: '11 months ago'}, {author: 'Qianna Stibbins', rating: 5, text: 'Grace and Brittany are AMAZING!! Everyone here is so kind and knowledgeable about their products, I love coming in here! 10/10 would recommend stopping by!', time: 'a month ago'}, {author: 'lekaloo', rating: 5, text: 'Any review mentioning rude staff or bizarre interactions strikes me as projecting or hypercritical. Like these people could walk into a yoga studio and declare one of the plants as distracting or intrusive. Problems can be found anywhere you look long enough to make one (or if there’s bias- can’t help but wonder if some of these folks expect femme presenting people to bend over backwards and coddl', time: '6 months ago'}, {author: 'Margaux Pierra', rating: 4, text: 'The place is stunning and the budtenders are lovely, the gummy selection is nice and they have good bud + vapes I will be coming back for those! … the pre rolls are kind of a rip off though for $22.75 after tax & card fees for an unsealed joint (a lot of loose bud in the cone) that was really badly rolled :( had to re roll at home', time: '5 months ago'}, {author: 'Ani D', rating: 5, text: 'The place is very clean and the staff was friendly and welcoming.  This was my first time in a dispensary and Carrie took the time to show me all of the different products and explained the differences between strengths and ingredients.  I will definitely be back!', time: '8 months ago'}] }
