        google: { rating: 5, review_count: 529, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=497623207070150284&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Hayley Ortwein', rating: 5, text: 'Extremely kind service workers, very knowledgeable and helpful. Every single person was considerate and communicative.  I think they said they are adding a medical component soon as well with licensing. Very clean well kept store.  Prices were decent pretty standard. I was able to get a decent deal on some disposables.  Lots of sales going on for all different products edibles inhalants etc.  Defi', time: 'a month ago'}, {author: 'Jo Schmidt', rating: 5, text: 'Love! I don’t know why I waited so long! I worked with Charlotte today and had a great experience after a terrible day. ❤️ I saw other brands I have previously enjoyed and picked up all new products I haven’t. 1000/10 would recommend!', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'O BLOCK', rating: 5, text: 'The staffing g here are great individuals. Taking care of there customers in every way. If not for frostbite dispensary. If nkt for them, I would be depressed knowing i cant get a supply chain in new brighton. Im grateful. Thank you frostbite dispensary.  RAYIEN. A good representative and excellent customer service. Thank you.', time: '4 months ago'}, {author: 'Jessica miller', rating: 5, text: 'Visiting up from Bemidji and OF COURSE had to get some goodies so decided to check this place out and it did not disappoint super friendly staff very helpful and knowledgeable and beautiful designing definitely worth a stop!', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'bre jones', rating: 5, text: 'Judy and Pete were really kind and patient. The cheetah piss left a good first impression!', time: '2 months ago'}] }
