        google: { rating: 4.6, review_count: 211, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=2343509097665817343&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'erik Turner', rating: 5, text: 'Stopped into Fridley Dispensary looking for something new and ended up getting recommended Super Boof by one of the staff members. Absolute awesome recommendation. The budtender didn’t just point me toward the “highest THC” option — they actually asked what I was specifically looking to achieve. You can tell the staff here actually uses and understands cannabis instead of reading off labels.  Supe', time: '5 months ago'}, {author: 'Malissa Adkins', rating: 5, text: 'I love coming to the Fridley Dispensary, the staff are so friendly and welcoming. Cash machines on site, a plethora of choices from flower to edibles. So close to my home which has quickly become my favorite stop. By the way you need to try “Grape Cream cake” have your couch and blanket ready! Whole body experience. Thank you 🙏 all of you are so amazing! Until next time… soon I’m sure 😂', time: '7 months ago'}, {author: 'janell obrien', rating: 5, text: 'Convenient location, ample parking, knowledgeable staff. Growing selection. More and more options every time I stop in. Staff has the knowledge to help you make the best choice so you have the right product. I personally ask for Tarah, she’s never had a bad suggestion. Rewards program if that’s your thing! I will definitely be back!!!', time: '5 months ago'}, {author: 'Perdida', rating: 1, text: 'Honestly not happy at all. Being medical it’s just so dry, it crumbles to a literal powder. Already wasn’t in the best mood and this just disappointed me. Aside from having one of the bud tenders just hovering over me and not really giving me time to just look gave me such an anxiety I wanted to just leave I didn’t even care to keep looking anymore. By far the worst dispensary I’ve been to and som', time: '4 months ago'}, {author: 'Megan DeBruin', rating: 5, text: 'Incredibly kind and knowledgeable staff.  Clean, professional yet relaxing store.  Great variety, great staff, great store.  10/10, this will be my home shop!', time: '3 months ago'}] }
