        img: "https://images.weedmaps.com/dispensaries/000/388/581/avatar/1770743314-ll_hk_wm_logo_.png",
        google: { rating: 4.1, review_count: 76, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=11331542417030810410&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Alex Busch', rating: 5, text: 'We love Lake Leaf! Incredibly kind, knowledgeable individuals in every step of the experience. Great quality, WAY BETTER prices than Rise or others. Worth the drive every time. We often pre-order and just run in to pick up. 11/10 best dispo prices and % in the state and I have visited nearly all!!', time: '6 months ago'}, {author: 'Tyler', rating: 5, text: 'Fantastic location, reasonable prices, and excellent staff. I visited once in the past during their grand opening, glad I visited again.  I reccomend the strain "Purple Milk," I haven\'t seen it anywhere else. The feeling is a nice fun giggly high. Flavor isn\'t intensely skunk, and hits very smooth.', time: '4 months ago'}, {author: 'Bob', rating: 1, text: 'Bought 2 - 4 gram bags.  Pictured is what was in the first one I opened. The second appeared correct. The first one had maybe .1 grams. Went back in the following day.  They said all sales are final no refunds. They did offer points to use towards my next purchase. Valued at less than half the value of the original bag. I said, so I\'m supposed to open the bag in here next time, they said yes. So t', time: '4 months ago'}, {author: 'Kevin Defoe', rating: 5, text: 'Great staff and very knowledgeable on their really good products. Selection has improved. Order online early in the day to make sure you get what you want, seems to sell fast. 1/8THS ARE 4GS HERE (not 3.5g like at other dispos).', time: '8 months ago'}, {author: 'Mysti Babineau', rating: 5, text: 'Compared to other dispenseries, their prices are lower. Staff is knowledgable and friendly! If youre looking for prices you should cjevk your local smoke shop and always inspect the product BEFORE purchase :)', time: '4 months ago'}] }
