        google: { rating: 4.7, review_count: 992, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=17509242439144634722&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Mar', rating: 5, text: '03/29/26 Edit: [see photo] Purchased Blue Waaboz and White Truffle today. The buds were nice and big, perfectly dried and they packed a punch!! 🤪💚  But I was impressed with the new packaging. The glass jars are great and the new round humidity pack that’s hidden under the cap is a major plus!! Nice 👍🏼I won’t be in a rush to put them in a mason jar.  11/23/26 Double points was the motivation that g', time: '6 months ago'}, {author: 'Gabriel Watkins', rating: 5, text: 'First time there, and it was a great experience. Had to show my ID way more than I\'m used to at a dispensary, but whatever, just do yourself a favor and keep it out. Once in the door, everyone greeting me was very friendly. I was partnered with a "weed guy" named Josh. He was cool, and it made the shopping go quick and smooth, what I want. Josh was easy to talk to and tell him what I wanted. I wor', time: '8 months ago'}, {author: 'Jennifer Demery', rating: 5, text: 'Staff was amazing, friendly and very knowledgeable about products. Always greeted with kindness and they have a good sense of humor. Have only purchased pre-rolls but will come back for sure', time: 'a year ago'}, {author: 'Dominick DeIeso', rating: 5, text: 'Awesome workers/budrenders. Super knowledgeable and friendly with some bomb ass kush. Shout out to Korbin for being an absolute beauty and helping a brother out. Can’t recommend this place enough no other dispo compares', time: 'a month ago'}, {author: 'Desiré Bogenreif', rating: 5, text: 'They guys are the real deal! The shiz nit seriously! They always hook me up, they\'re funny as heck! Super sweet and extremely helpful and let me tell you their smoke NEVER disappoints! Highly recommend! Stay high friends!🩷✨️💨🍃', time: '2 months ago'}] }
