        review_count: 681,
        verified: true,
        features: ["Medical + adult-use", "Statewide chain"],
        gradient: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #166534, #22c55e)',
        initial: 'GG',
        img: null,
        google: { rating: 4.3, review_count: 681, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=14048419485981313691&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'D Wes Armistead', rating: 5, text: 'Hannah was the one who took care of me and I had a good personal experience. I usually go with my partner, but this week I went alone and I really do highly recommend this one over the knee next door to my job. The prices are way better here especially in our economy. This was actually the first place I saw when I moved here so I was happy to see when they were open to the public. Worth the wait. ', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Ben Seals', rating: 5, text: 'It was a pretty nice place i cant complain.  My favorite was as soon as you walk in all you smell is the herbal flower. Nice people that work there please look pretty clean. Tom pretty good product. Good prices for the herb wasn\'t too busy got in and out bathrooms are clean all in all it was a pretty nice place. I would definitely recommend this place to anybody that asks', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Aaron Spading', rating: 3, text: 'In from out of town and I’m shocked at how expensive weed is in MN. Worse than maybe anywhere. But, three stars cuz this place’s prices were below anywhere else I found by a margin. If you must use a dispensary in the Twin Cities, this may be your best bet.  Although, after originally posting a solid review based only on prices, I bought $30 worth of pre-rolls that wouldn’t smoke they were poorly ', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Mar', rating: 5, text: 'Updated:  June 27,2025 After trying the BW Cap Junky and seeing the 50% sale I was compelled to try BW Sour Jack. 🤤yum It claims a THC 20% but it felt like a 26%. Great aftertaste. It was packaged 2/2025 and I opened it today (photos).💚  Say hello and welcome new man TJ W. You’ll learn much from MJ.  June 21, 2025 I’ve never smoked any of the Boundary Waters flowers so I bought the Cap Junky Pre-r', time: 'a year ago'}, {author: 'Vivica De la Rouje', rating: 1, text: 'For my first time I didn’t think staff were very helpful at all. It’s kind of like an in and out business. Just people rushing in and out. NO CUSTOMER SERVICE WHATSOEVER. I typically don’t partake in cannabis and had some questions like even how to use the machine to order. I’m not slow I just had some questions before I spend my hard earned money. Also the front desk man is literally on autopilot', time: '2 months ago'}] }
