        initial: 'GG',
        img: null,
        google: { rating: 4.5, review_count: 874, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=14384096910807857338&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Tamara Sims', rating: 4, text: 'Fast, friendly & reasonable prices compared to some other dispensaries in the area. Occassionally I\'ve ended up with dry products, though always tasty & effective! Online ordering- I strongly suggest you call the shop a short time after ordering (during shop hours) to be SURE they received your order from the, "Jane" portal that is 3rd party. I had to order twice one day after waiting for about 30', time: '5 months ago'}, {author: 'Mathew Bauler', rating: 2, text: 'I\'ve only been to this place once and maybe it was bad timing, but the vibe of this place was like going to the DMV. The ambiance was drab and dour and the employees were not friendly and seemed annoyed to be there. Even the customers seemed disgruntled.  I have a new medical card for autism and there was no greeting or direction or explanation of how anything works so I just felt confused and out', time: '7 months ago'}, {author: 'Hi', rating: 1, text: 'This worker named Sam and Kiara were being very rude and were giving me nasty looks while shopping. I asked for help and they just sent me to the devices. I don’t like the customer service provided here I visited other green goods and have gotten much warmer reception. If you value your experience DO NOT GO HERE. I called the Manager and they told me there was nothing wrong with that. Never in my ', time: '5 months ago'}, {author: 'Joanne Thorne', rating: 5, text: 'Fast friendly service and suggestions Absolutely will be coming back at least once a month or every 2 weeks! Fantastic place close to home', time: 'a month ago'}, {author: 'Seth Pierce', rating: 5, text: 'Very friendly staff with quick service! I highly recommend ordering ahead of time. It makes it easier for you and them 👍🏼', time: '5 months ago'}] }
