        google: { rating: 4.4, review_count: 938, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=1526852106365911449&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Abel Urizar', rating: 1, text: 'I’ve been coming here as a med patient for 3 years now. Customer service has always been horrible here. I just called today just to get some clarification on their flower and i thought I was talking to my phone without a call being connected. Just quietness, a pause and then an answer as I was even stupid for asking. The staff at Rise are much more professional and friendly at the same time while ', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Solo Bcuz', rating: 3, text: 'I\'ve been going here medically for a couple of years. They\'re nice people.  Good customer service.  Knowledgeable staff.  As far as the company.  Prices are kind of high.  Higher than most everyone else\'s. The product on sale,  is the throw away buds and product that will expire in a month.  Just hard little boogers rolling around. They need more and better deals. I spent $1,700 and my points rewa', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'D. D.', rating: 1, text: 'Well, it was fantastic at first, out of the blue, despite my always positive attitude and kindness, generous tips, to all staff, one day I noticed they had been kinda quiet, not the normal "happy to see me, " That I\'m used to. after that, it just kept getting worse. To the point I stopped coming back. And I will forever stay away because of it. Even though this will be posted anon, I know in my he', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Sharon Flor', rating: 2, text: 'Medical patients are suffering due to recreational users using up the stuff that helped. I\'m looking for RSO ANYWHERE.  The ONE THING that helped is ALWAYS out of stock since Rec opened.  Medical patients got shoved to the side. PROFIT seems to be what you care about most now. Its sad. I\'ve also received vapes that stopped working while still half full. The SIMPLE $110.00 vapes are always doing th', time: '6 months ago'}, {author: 'harlan prine', rating: 1, text: 'Only game in town so far. Last time I went unknown to me, I had to make 2 separate transactions to get the discounts I shopped for. That created a lot of embarrassment and I felt threatened. The Manager came out and cleared thing up.  She seemed objective and knowledgeable.  And the staff learned.  Why can\'t some have more patience?  They get violent when you ask a question by having a large man h', time: '7 months ago'}] }
