        google: { rating: 4.5, review_count: 473, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=16575895052456821740&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Kris Hippe', rating: 5, text: 'Since I became a medical patient years ago, this place has always been my go to the staff is always amazing welcoming and warming and professional and the product is absolutely top-notch. I would never go anywhere else. I love you guys. Keep up the great work.!! And bonus if Prince is there the little dog he’s so cute!!', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'JJ ODonnell', rating: 5, text: 'I had ordered my medicine before the store opened.  I went into the store as normal.  There were only 2 people working in the store one was at the door and the other was at the counter.  There was a guy in there who began getting upset because of a 5 minute wait time.  The staff were professional and kept their cool.  As the man was threatening to leave if he didn\'t get his stuff soon.  Staff just', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Emma Sattler', rating: 5, text: 'Welcoming, mellow, professional, knowledgable staff. You select your product in the store via one of their several available ipads, then they gather your selected items from the back and ready for checkout in less than 5 mins.  I appreciate the buying experience with use of iPad, because it allows you to browse available items and take your time / ask questions if needed, rather than feeling rushe', time: '6 months ago'}, {author: 'Sandi Mullen', rating: 5, text: 'Was my first visit, it was very welcoming, friendly atmosphere, the knowledge of the employees were amazing. I ordered Black Maple flower and Flat Jacks flower  both hands down. The relaxation was awesome and I slept like a baby which was also awesome. Will definitely be back', time: 'a year ago'}, {author: 'Bridget Johnson', rating: 4, text: 'Great place and customer service. My child has her license and uses full CBD medical products(violet tablets, 50 mg), but they have not restocked since April. Very frustrating. We were on a good cadence, but now we have to roll the dice on using recreational. All recreational has at most 25mg of CBD, which is very expensive when trying to consume 300mg daily. Not everyone needs THC!!! In kids it c', time: 'a month ago'}] }
