        google: { rating: 4.5, review_count: 758, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=8248783567701723195&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Crystal Holtgrewe', rating: 5, text: 'I love Green Goods! They have the BEST rewards system. AND, they have DYLAN!!! Dylan is always super friendly, helpful, and knowledgeable. He always greets me by name with smile. It may seem like a small thing, a personalized greeting in a smile, But you never know what somebody’s going through, That could completely turn somebody’s day around. So, Dylan, Thank you for being you because you are aw', time: '4 months ago'}, {author: 'Jw Doom', rating: 5, text: 'Hannah was such a great help with my order today. Answered all the questions I had and even informed me kindly on the new payment method with connecting your bank to pay. One of the best employees they have by far!', time: 'a month ago'}, {author: 'Keyandria Sloan', rating: 5, text: 'Dylan, I just want to say thank you again! You took the time out to explain things, and that’s exactly what I needed. I appreciate you for going out of your way. This location will be my go-to location. Customer service is superb!', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Darla Jones', rating: 5, text: 'Dylan was great.  We discussed exactly where I should start & what I should look for to see if the dose is too low or too high.  He was patient & explained things well.  He explained that due to state testing delays, they are temporarily out of topical. It\'s a comfort that they want their product tested. Everyone was nice. I recommend this place.', time: '5 months ago'}, {author: 'Danielle Coffey', rating: 5, text: 'Kate is the bomb. I was having a bad day and she said I had nice hair. I needed that. She goes above and beyond while remaining chill and cool. Hannah always has a smile and I\'m excited when I see her. She gives great suggestions. I\'m a bargain hunter so the strain of the week is my favorite. Best priced pre- rolls. Really happy with this place. Make an account on their website and order ahead for', time: '2 months ago'}] }
