        gradient: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #166534, #22c55e)',
        initial: 'RD',
        img: null,
        google: { rating: 4.8, review_count: 678, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=12002727602885414247&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Joseph Lopez', rating: 5, text: '⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ Tessa was amazing! She was friendly, welcoming, and very knowledgeable. She took the time to answer all my questions, made great recommendations, and made the whole experience easy and comfortable. Her customer service was outstanding, and I never felt rushed. I\'ll definitely be coming back and hope to work with Tessa again. Thanks for the excellent service!', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Kaylee Gerdes', rating: 5, text: 'Tessa helped me out at the front, she was so incredibly nice! Complimented me twice and told me about all the deals and how to sign up for an account! She made me feel so incredibly welcomed and comfortable! Even offered to help me pick out something out, sweetest lady (:', time: 'a month ago'}, {author: 'Kandus Cutrer', rating: 5, text: 'I love going into this place!! They have all been so absolutely amazing and kind! The flower and pens are always on point!  Tessa helped me out A lot this last time I was in! She held down it down by herself and communicated to those of us that were waiting. You got you a great one there!', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Dmitry Suter', rating: 5, text: 'Tessa helped me out and it was honestly incredible. Very easy. She was very nice and I would gladly come back again because of her. The weed absolutely incredible the service perfect', time: 'a month ago'}, {author: 'Andrea Pelkey', rating: 5, text: 'So fast and efficient here! Jordan helped me today and was AMAZING! So friendly,helpful, and made sure to help the customers in the order they came in! She’s helped me a few times now and I always know I’m in good hands🫶🏻  I was back again 🤩 Shelby helped me this time! Such a fun vibe and experience with her! I put in a extra order when I arrived so we had to wait just a few extra minutes for that', time: '2 months ago'}] }
