        gradient: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #166534, #22c55e)',
        initial: 'FF',
        img: null,
        google: { rating: 4.5, review_count: 133, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=18107946376399637410&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Top Notch Reviews', rating: 5, text: 'So as people who know/follow me, I am a MM patient and I have been for years now. So of course I already have the pleasure of tax free cannabis products. I am a frequent heavy user because I use for pain, sleep and I have cancer. That being said. I have a hard time getting concentrate. And it\'s pricey. So I purchased a 2g of the indica. I have the perfect set up for concentrate. So I been dabbing ', time: '5 months ago'}, {author: 'Brandon', rating: 5, text: 'Wow! First off I have to compliment the esthetic of the whole place. Easy to find and a lot of variety for all your needs. Service was top notch and friendly, even when coming in a little bit closer to closing. Would 100% recommend (:', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Maddie Kranz', rating: 5, text: 'Great spot, immaculate interior, amazing staff, fairest prices in the Twin Cities area. Trace was very patient and helpful, so were the floor and deli staff. Highly recommend checking out! If you’re on the hunt for the best dispensary in town this is it.', time: '6 months ago'}, {author: 'Alex Inamagua (Alexito)', rating: 5, text: 'This place is hella cool. I’ve been going here to get my flower and concentrates since April. Lots of options and the service and bud tenders are really nice and helpful. Keep up the varieties, guys im all about quality and quantity 💪🏽', time: '5 months ago'}, {author: 'Jacob', rating: 2, text: 'Checked out Flame & Flora for their grand opening today.  Gotta give credit where it’s due, the staff was super friendly, welcoming, and you could tell everyone was excited. The energy and vibes were great, especially for opening day.  That said… I picked up their Dark Rainbow #1 and it was honestly a big letdown. The quality just wasn’t there. It was mostly leafy, poorly trimmed, and felt rushed,', time: '6 months ago'}] }
