        initial: 'HA',
        img: null,
        google: { rating: 4, review_count: 63, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=15519840295758127880&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Lindsay Hoffman', rating: 5, text: 'This dispensary has great inventory! The vibes were there and everyone was so nice! I got the cannabis infused moon rock Candis, a gummy pack, a mushroom vape and THC drink. They were all good!!', time: '5 months ago'}, {author: 'Patrick Rodriguez', rating: 1, text: 'For a place that has three other dispensaries within a few miles and another one right down the road, I honestly don’t understand how they are still operating more like a smoke shop than a legitimate dispensary.  The product selection was extremely disappointing. Much of what I saw was hemp or tobacco-related, along with products that I’ve seen banned, removed, or no longer carried by other reputa', time: 'a month ago'}, {author: 'Peter Rico', rating: 5, text: 'Stopped by Huff & Puff and had a really good experience. The staff was super friendly and easy to talk to. They helped me find exactly what I was looking for and answered all my questions without trying to upsell me on a bunch of stuff.  The store is clean, has a good vibe, and a nice selection of products. Prices were reasonable, and the whole process was quick and easy.  Definitely one of the be', time: '4 months ago'}, {author: 'Mesa', rating: 1, text: 'This experience was a 1/10  I am loving checking out all the new dispensaries popping up in Minnesota so when I saw a new one near my house I risked the ice cream in my car to stop and check it out.  The shop is pretty small, I walked in with my partner and I was more than ready to provide my ID, then when asked for my phone number I asked "what for?" And was told "you have to before you can go ba', time: '5 months ago'}, {author: 'Koffi Arizamoto', rating: 1, text: 'Very misleading. $20 a "pre-roll". Labeled as a dispensary but theres less than 1% THC. A dispensary is supposed to sell pot. Not hemp sprayed with delta-8 and charging more than pot prices. Stick to the streets and let this die off. Its not even advertised as hemp products. Can\'t spend my money at a place that intentionally misleads customers. The only nice thing I have to say is that the bongs a', time: '3 months ago'}] }
