        google: { rating: 4.6, review_count: 61, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=15964461570412428707&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Tenia Clendenin', rating: 5, text: 'I’m obsessed with Silver Therapeutics! The staff is easily the friendliest budtenders I’ve ever come across. Super helpful, super knowledgeable, super informative, especially for beginners. They’ll take you around the store and ask you questions to get to know your cannabis profile and give you awesome recommendations. Highly recommend stopping in to check them out.', time: '5 months ago'}, {author: 'Jaden Lee', rating: 5, text: 'Super friendly and knowledgeable staff! My Bud tender Brea, educated me on terps and all the different the profiles each flower had. Great experience!', time: '4 months ago'}, {author: 'nancy newman', rating: 5, text: 'Very pleasant and helpful staff, felt very comfortable with my experience there.   Also really appreciate the rewards n discount offers right away after my first visit. I was back for that and will continue to enjoy the great products. Thank you!', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Shanna Gagliardi', rating: 5, text: 'Tenia, was my budtender 😊🌱. Love the store, calm and good vibes from the atmosphere and every employee I met!  Amazing product selection and great price.  Overall wonderful experience, that was my second time there and I’ve had nothing but fabulous customer service.', time: '4 months ago'}, {author: 'Jesus', rating: 5, text: 'I’ve waited forever for a dispensary in Stillwater and I’m so happy this is the one that’s here. The inside is so cozy and welcoming, the staff are super friendly and resourceful. Tenia was my cashier and her smile just makes you smile. Fast transaction, great attitude, and awesome recommendations. Really really happy you guys are here. Great team and great product!', time: '3 months ago'}] }
