        google: { rating: 4.7, review_count: 92, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=6500605847053397624&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Beth Lilja', rating: 5, text: 'Green Leaf Depot is hands-down one of the best retail experiences I’ve had—period. The store is clean, welcoming, and truly classy, which immediately sets it apart. As a working professional, I feel completely comfortable stopping in after work, knowing the environment is respectful, well-run, and professional from start to finish.  What really stands out is the knowledge and thoughtfulness of the', time: '9 months ago'}, {author: 'Aaron Snyder', rating: 5, text: 'From the second we walked in I could tell this was going to be my new spot.  Phenomenal service (like hella phenomenal), incredible knowledge and just a super "dope" staff. Legit sat and talked to them for like 10 min after the purchase. They\'re just good, down to earth and honest  people.  I appreciate you all!', time: '8 months ago'}, {author: 'Jonathan Edwards', rating: 5, text: 'Best in class service! These folks know how to treat their customers to good conversation and knowledge that doesn’t make you feel less than for not knowing. If you’re trying for the first time, they’ll take phenomenal care of you. As an added bonus their rewards system seems to be unmatched, so you either get essentially a discount or outright free product during consecutive visits! I would trust', time: '7 months ago'}, {author: 'COVID-Shark', rating: 1, text: 'I just drove to this place after talking to I believe it was Jonathan on the phone who confirmed I would get my medical discount on the flower I was asking about. I drove all the way from Prior Lake just to come to this location for that deal to get here and to be told that they won’t honor it. Even though I was told on the phone they would. The gentleman here checked with the manager and he said ', time: '4 months ago'}, {author: 'Connie Herbst', rating: 5, text: 'The 3 people I was in contact with were the best. No, I don\'t know there names but they didn\'t make me feel out of place. They made making my purchase the easiest thing ever. They helped when I told them what I was looking for. I will definitely go back there to purchase. At my age I need to know that the ones I talk to know what I need when I explain myself. Great group of people. Thank you.', time: '6 months ago'}] }
