        google: { rating: 4.9, review_count: 70, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=10754368847900767459&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Kim Deisher', rating: 5, text: 'Great little store with lots of choices including CBD treats for pets. My dogs love them! Marissa was so helpful and knowledgeable about all the products. She also was able to talk to me as someone from out of state, about the laws and regulations and how the landscape is changing towards recreational use.  10000/10, will go back if we’re in the area again. Stop by to check out their awesome selec', time: 'a year ago'}, {author: 'I’m Dontai', rating: 3, text: 'Good spot for beginners or people with low tolerance. If you’re a heavy THC user though, don’t expect much—felt more like I was just buying expensive fruit snacks and leaving a donation.', time: '6 months ago'}, {author: 'Stephen Eigenmann', rating: 5, text: 'Great CBD store and hemp derived edible products. They carry a wide variety of products and it’s great speaking with their staff who are knowledgeable and caring. I really enjoyed my visit there today and left with some good products.', time: '2 years ago'}, {author: 'Dani Clevenger', rating: 5, text: 'Every product I have tried from their store has helped me with exactly why I went there. The staff & owners are very knowledgeable in this field. Come to find out they have their products now and they\'re even better! I slept like a baby.', time: 'a year ago'}, {author: 'Sheri Witkowski', rating: 5, text: 'Jerry was awesome man!! We chatted for the longest time! Very knowledgeable showed me pix of his setup.. very cool!  The product I purchased is outstanding!! Like my mushroom art from the Funky Fungi too🍄!! See you next year, for sure!! Thanks Jerry!!', time: '9 months ago'}] }
