        google: { rating: 4.9, review_count: 43, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=16244472806207016801&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Chris.P Bacon', rating: 5, text: 'I\'ve visited 3 times now and haven\'t been disappointed yet! All very good choices or flower very good smell i LOVE the Donny Burger ❤️ (pictured) I\'ll definitely be returning,  they give out penny pre rolls for a .01 cent half gram pree roll with some purchases ☺️ My only complaint is they dont have tap to pay and both times I\'ve paid with a card I was charged an extra $6 "Atm" fee just for paying', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'ImNotAMario', rating: 5, text: 'Fantastic atmosphere and incredibly friendly staff! I feel like a friend when I come in, and the quality of their products will sit you right down.', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Sheldon Pfieffer', rating: 5, text: 'Such a cool place prices are a little high but thats to be expected. AWSOME and knowledgeable staff. LOVE the little sample line where you can see what the product looks like.', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Denise M (Neisey Pooh)', rating: 5, text: 'Love this place. Come in check it out. Everyone here are very lovely people. All I can say is it looks beautiful and don\'t miss out. Run don\'t walk!!!', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Bailee Johnson', rating: 5, text: 'The people in there are always so nice and helpful. They can answer any questions you have about any products there and always make you feel very welcomed. I love the set up And the variety of strains! 10 out of 10, will be going back!', time: '2 months ago'}] }
