        google: { rating: 4.7, review_count: 154, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=17419024291603902230&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Blaze', rating: 5, text: 'Good shop, reasonable prices. The price you see is the price you pay, or “out the door” pricing, which I really appreciate. The owner was super chill and easy to talk to, good customer service. Would definitely return to support this shop in the future', time: '4 months ago'}, {author: 'Zack Caruson', rating: 5, text: 'Knowledgeable staff that are always honest with what they have and don\'t. Not many as honest as these guys in the business, especially locally.  All the 1 star reviews are either from people mad they can\'t park in his spot from the coffee shop, or from pushy customers who legit budge the line.  Dont hesitate to shop here.', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Elijah “Eli”', rating: 5, text: 'Very friendly and nice staff. I’m visiting from Florida. Loved the atmosphere! Great Prices and Team.', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Jenn Groenke', rating: 5, text: 'Can’t say enough good things about Twin Cities Cannabis! Amazing products, great atmosphere, and always a welcoming experience. Definitely a favorite spot! 💚', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Jessica and Larissa at Going Green', rating: 5, text: 'We had a really great experience working with them. Everything went smoothly, and communication was open the whole way through. Their team was flexible and super easy to coordinate with, which made the process stress-free on our end. We really appreciated how collaborative and easygoing they were. We’d definitely love to work together again in the future.', time: '5 months ago'}] }
