        google: { rating: 4.5, review_count: 1466, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=6125327960312944220&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'Oni Kirai', rating: 5, text: 'Great shop, decent prices for med card holders. Always fast service, operates like very well oiled machine  Only complaint is they have a terrible sativa flower selection. 1-2 options is not enough.', time: '4 months ago'}, {author: 'Sara reece ב״ה Conrad-glanman', rating: 5, text: 'I’ve had the chance to work with Hussain and honestly, he’s one of the best people I’ve worked with. He’s sharp, dependable, and genuinely cares about getting things right. No matter how complex the task, Hussein breaks it down and delivers results that are clean, thoughtful, and on time. He communicates clearly, takes feedback well, and always goes the extra step to make sure the outcome actually', time: '3 months ago'}, {author: 'Joshua Portwood', rating: 5, text: 'Always a pleasant purchasing experience with this awesome staff over in Eagan. In-store pickup is always quick and easy, and the counter staff is incredibly nice and knowledgeable. Delivery is as easy as it gets, and have never failed to make the delivery even when they get far behind or are short staffed. Shout out to delivery guy Matt, dude was all smiles and great vibes.', time: 'a month ago'}, {author: 'Heather Malais', rating: 5, text: 'Update- Romeo is the best as usual and always makes me feel welcome, and the product is still superb (solventless animal face is my current go to) and the RSO is great for my pain relief.  I always feel comfortable picking up my medication, Andy is always super welcoming and very knowledgeable. Product is always great as well.  It looks like my last review got deleted - Romeo is also always very f', time: '2 months ago'}, {author: 'Sienna Casos', rating: 5, text: 'Had a super great experience here a few weeks back. I just moved back to the area and haven’t gotten a chance to get super familiar with the processes here. Miri was so great in answering my all of my questions. When I asked for more information about how to get a medical card here, she took quite a bit of time to talk me through the process and gave me some referrals for services. She was so swee', time: '3 months ago'}] }
