        gradient: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #92400e, #d97706)',
        initial: 'CA',
        img: "https://images.weedmaps.com/dispensaries/000/408/843/avatar/1782263012-submark_full_color_500.png",
        google: { rating: 4.9, review_count: 56, maps_url: 'https://maps.google.com/?cid=11846765683124748858&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA', reviews: [{author: 'EveryBody Massage', rating: 5, text: 'Erin and Bob are first and foremost, exceptional humans. Every time I visit, I am met with a enthusiastic "hello" and a smile. They are knowledgeable and passionate about the process of cultivating cannabis from seed to flower. They offer a punch card that earns you a free thc drink after you purchase 10. Honestly my favorite place to visit because of how much they care about helping others throug', time: '7 months ago'}, {author: 'Tony Reick', rating: 5, text: 'I have had a great experience at their store. I\'ve been there twice and met Bob the first time and his wife Erin the second time I came in. They were both very knowledgeable about their products and we\'re able to find what I needed. They let me know if I had any issues just to let them know and they would take care of it.Great customer service thanks again!🌞', time: '8 months ago'}, {author: 'D B', rating: 5, text: 'Wonderful shop, the manager (i think they were the manager ) knows so much and is super welcoming. Great vibe inside and just a place you kind of want to be. Tons of options. And yeah, all together will be coming back. Also promotes the arts inside (loved seeing all the art on the walls) hope more stores take after it.  There is also a seed bank inside, with details for first time growers. Auto se', time: 'a year ago'}, {author: 'Ashley Ashley', rating: 5, text: 'HIGHLY RECOMMEND, TYSM!!! Went and bought my first batch from Erin, and  She was the sweetest thing !!!! We definitely need to be best friends. She gave me a bunch of free stickers and goodies some joint papers a little tube to hold my joint in and even A FREE seed!!!!! They also get together there every Thursday as a community, which I believe is free and on their site they give you the option to', time: 'a year ago'}, {author: 'Julia Deak', rating: 5, text: 'The community energy it brings alone is worth giving a visit to. On top of that their seeds are incredible. Great quality, great price, great energy. Erin and Bob know the deal and are super cool!!! Love coming in here 😊', time: 'a year ago'}] }
